  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 7th level, an aethernaut is unimpaired and unharmed by natural difficult terrain and the planar traits of his current plane of existence. For example, this protects him from the normal heat of the Plane of Fire but not hot areas on other planes. It prevents his light spells from being impeded on the Shadow Plane and prevents him from suffocating on the Plane of Earth or Plane of Water, but not elsewhere. It does not protect him from the vacuum of space.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/aethernaut#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
